        "procedure": "An aqueous solution of NH4acac (75 mL, 2 mol/L) was added slowly with stirring to a solution of 0.1 mmol ErCl3·6H2O (0.381 g) in 10 mL cold water. Aqueous NH3 (1.0 M) was added to keep the pH at 7.0–7.5, giving white precipitates. Stirring was continued for about 2 h; the precipitates were filtered, washed with water, and air-dried. Block colorless crystals of 1 were obtained by recrystallization from toluene (5 mL).",
